# The orthogonal A₅ branch of the almost-special argument

`Hypothesis.lemma_G_2_4_source` proves all eight clauses, including the actual
natural upper module, marked quotient images and exact order formula.
The terminal implication gives I=L, S=V_L, the intrinsic A₅-block and
U=O₂(L₁)≅Q₈∘Q₈. Its quaternion presentation retains the actual factors
and their common center V₁. The literal §13.5 applications discharge every
internal structural and terminal premise from the source setup and relative
normality, while preserving the original seed, residual and H-closure.

The universal field-four G.1.3 implication is proved from the projective
criterion and applied to the original upper quotient. G.2.2 is also proved
and used directly. The orthogonal A₅ module and natural SL₂(4) layers remain
distinct throughout. The older conditional assembly interfaces are preserved.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, combined manuscript of 1 March 2004,
Lemma G.2.4, printed pp.334–335, PDF pp.345–346.
